---
title: "Fence Installation"
description: "Sturdy, reliable boundary and privacy fencing built to withstand the elements and secure your perimeter."
ogUrl: services/fence-installation.html
root: "../"
active: "services"
faq:
  - q: "How long does a fence installation take?"
    a: "A typical residential fence (150–250 linear feet) takes 2–4 days depending on material and ground conditions."
  - q: "Do I need a permit for a new fence?"
    a: "Permit requirements vary by city and HOA. We'll help you check local requirements before work begins."
  - q: "Can you repair just one section instead of replacing the whole fence?"
    a: "Yes — we regularly handle spot repairs for storm damage, rot, or impact rather than a full replacement when the rest of the fence is sound."
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "head.njk" %}
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
  {% include "icons.njk" %}
  {% include "nav.njk" %}
<main id="main">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="section" style="padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="../index.html">Home</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <a href="../services.html">Services</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="current">Fence Installation</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-label">Service</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Fence Installation</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Sturdy, reliable boundary and privacy fencing built to withstand the elements and secure your perimeter.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-actions">
        <a href="../contact.html" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="../portfolio.html" class="btn-ghost">See Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICE DETAIL -->
  <section style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="service-detail-layout">
        <div class="service-detail-main" data-aos="fade-up">
          <p class="lead">Whether you need a new privacy fence, a boundary line repair, or a full perimeter rebuild, we install fencing that's built to handle Colorado wind, snow load, and freeze-thaw cycles — not just look good for the first season.</p>

          <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; color:var(--bark); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">What's included</h3>
          <ul class="service-include-list">
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Wood, vinyl, and chain-link fence installation</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Post setting with proper depth and concrete footing for our soil and frost line</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Gate installation and hardware fitting</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Repair of leaning posts, broken panels, and storm damage</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Property line and HOA-compliant layout planning</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Staining and sealing for wood fencing</span></li>
          </ul>

      <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-label">From Our Portfolio</p>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; color:var(--bark); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">Related projects</h3>
        <div class="related-portfolio-strip">
        <a href="../portfolio.html" class="related-portfolio-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <img src="../images/stairsafter.webp" alt="Custom built staircase with finished woodwork" loading="lazy">
          <div class="related-portfolio-card-body">
            <h5>Custom Staircase</h5>
            <span>Carpentry · Niwot, CO</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="../portfolio.html" class="related-portfolio-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <img src="../images/after/steps-after.webp" alt="Rebuilt stone steps with proper foundation" loading="lazy">
          <div class="related-portfolio-card-body">
            <h5>Steps</h5>
            <span>Hardscaping · Boulder, CO</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.5rem">
          <a href="../portfolio.html" class="btn-primary">View Full Portfolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="service-sidebar" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h4>Other Services</h4>
          <ul class="service-sidebar-list">
          {% for cs in services %}{% if cs.slug != page.fileSlug %}
          <li><a href="{{ cs.slug }}.html">{{ cs.title }}</a></li>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <a href="../contact.html" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
          <div class="service-sidebar-contact">
            Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" style="background:var(--straw);">
    <div class="section">
      <p class="section-label">Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Fence Installation <em>FAQs</em></h2>
      <div class="faq-container" data-aos="fade-up">
        {% for item in faq %}
        <div class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 100 }}">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-question">{{ item.q }}</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{{ item.a }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST BADGES -->
  <section id="trust" style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section" style="padding:3rem 2.5rem;">
      <div class="trust-badges">
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-shield"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Licensed & Insured</strong><br><small>Full coverage protection</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg></div>
